    "title": "» Jury Selection Underway for Double Homicide After Two Mistrials - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editor’s Corner ,\n12 hours ago After a previous hung jury in June 2025 and another in May, Khaleb Edmonds, 26, is set to stand trial once again for a double homicide. Edmonds is charged with two counts of first-degree murder and three firearm violations in connection to the fatal shootings of two 26-year-old men; Myron White and Darius Hill on Aug. 24, 2023 in Mondawmin. Read full article\n1",
